<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apasco raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apasco raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said on Monday it had upgraded its rating on Mexican cement company Apasco S.A. de C.V. to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We have increased our margin assumptions for 1996 and 1997 due to continued strong company performance throughout 1996,&quot; analysts Bonnie Rosenberg and Samantha Sparks wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- They raised their estimates for earnings per American Depositary Receipt to $2.55 for 1996 and $3.05 for 1997, from $1.96 and $2.16, respectively.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
